    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.poster.avif?t=1741943615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.webm?t=1741943615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.mp4?t=1741943615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Deck, 19 Poker Hands, 172 Functional Cards, 21 Boosters, 39 Villains, 2 Gameplay Mechanics, and a flexible variety of strategy combinations\u2014endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Joker Ascent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Villain debuffs stack and activate, with Dark Deck that negates player actions, adding more strategy and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Jack&amp;Joker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the strategy of Joker and Poker Hands with classic Yatzy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw and Hold Playing Cards,match target Poker Hands to defeat Villains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-PvP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite seed in Joker Ascent, duel with friends or strangers, and win rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Ability Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading ability decks allows you to carry more resources, gain powerful special abilities, and unlock certain Joker cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 Joker cards with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Tarot cards that argument playing cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Spell cards that boost Hand and Joker cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Zodiac cards that upgrade Poker Hands with 1-3 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Boosters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Empowerments and 7 Sigils provide bonus effects to Playing Cards and Jokers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Perks grant special buffs in [Joker Ascent]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules make it easy,but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealth of elements and possibilities await your discovery!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.poster.avif?t=1741943615\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.webm?t=1741943615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082990/extras/f7f215ad3f99404988bc8aeffcfcaae1.mp4?t=1741943615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Deck, 19 Poker Hands, 172 Functional Cards, 21 Boosters, 39 Villains, 2 Gameplay Mechanics, and a flexible variety of strategy combinations\u2014endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Joker Ascent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Villain debuffs stack and activate, with Dark Deck that negates player actions, adding more strategy and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Jack&amp;Joker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the strategy of Joker and Poker Hands with classic Yatzy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw and Hold Playing Cards,match target Poker Hands to defeat Villains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-PvP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite seed in Joker Ascent, duel with friends or strangers, and win rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Ability Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading ability decks allows you to carry more resources, gain powerful special abilities, and unlock certain Joker cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 Joker cards with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Tarot cards that argument playing cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Spell cards that boost Hand and Joker cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Zodiac cards that upgrade Poker Hands with 1-3 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-Boosters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Empowerments and 7 Sigils provide bonus effects to Playing Cards and Jokers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Perks grant special buffs in [Joker Ascent]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules make it easy,but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealth of elements and possibilities await your discovery!</p>",
